{"name":"Gentle Grey","hex":"#dee0e1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gentle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Tender and amiable; of a considerate or kindly disposition.","Soft and mild rather than hard or severe."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To become gentle.","To ennoble."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gentle"},{"term":"grey","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Commonwealth standard spelling of gray.","Synonym of coloured (pertaining to the mixed race of black and white)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Commonwealth standard spelling of gray."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/grey"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gentle (character)","blocks":[{"text":"Gentle is a character appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. Originally from Wakanda, Gentle is a mutant with the ability to increase his muscle mass, giving him immense strength. The character has commonly been depicted as a member of the student body of the Xavier Institute and has also been part of the X-Men."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/56/Gentleprofile.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gentle_(character)","wikidata":"Q3760162"},{"title":"Grey","blocks":[{"text":"Grey or gray is an intermediate color between black and white. It is a neutral or achromatic color, meaning that it has no chroma. It is the color of a rain or storm cloud, of ash, and of lead."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Loxodonta_africana_by_Ron_Cogswell.jpg/330px-Loxodonta_africana_by_Ron_Cogswell.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grey","wikidata":"Q42519"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a3/Gentlepower.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_un